    {
      "path": "docs/CLI-v0.2-plan.md",
      "content": "# CLI v0.2 Implementation Plan\n\n## New Commands\n\n### actp capture\nactp capture \"decision content\" --symbol ??\nAppends decision to packet. Symbol sets priority.\n\n### actp rehydrate\nactp rehydrate ./context.actp.json\nOutputs formatted prompt header for cross-model transfer.\n\n### actp save\nactp save --message \"commit message\"\nSaves versioned snapshot.\n\n### actp diff\nactp diff v1.actp.json v2.actp.json\nCompares two packet versions.\n\n### actp merge\nactp merge a.actp.json b.actp.json\nMerges packets using D9 conflict resolution.\n\n### actp sync\nactp sync --push / --pull\nSyncs with cloud. Requires actp login.\n\n## Implementation Order\n1. capture (LOW complexity)\n2. rehydrate (LOW complexity)\n3. save (MEDIUM)\n4. diff (MEDIUM)\n5. sync (HIGH)\n6. merge (HIGH)\n",
      "size": 756,
      "type": "text",
      "checksum": "0810685749ba3f5708dd91638e7598791a2dc11b5f84974735e581796656e0a2"
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/architecture.md",
      "content": "# ACTP Application Architecture\n\n**Decision source:** BENCH-002 consensus (Claude + ChatGPT + Gemini)\n\n## Platform Roadmap\n- Phase 1: CLI (v0.1 complete)\n- Phase 2: VS Code Extension\n- Phase 3: Web App (actp.dev)\n\n## Data Architecture\n\n### Local (offline-first)\n~/.actp/\n  config.json\n  packets/\n    <project-name>/\n      current.actp.json\n      versions/\n\n### Cloud (optional sync)\n- PostgreSQL: users, packets, versions\n- Conflict resolution: D9 branch-both + vector clocks\n- P0 tie: human-in-the-loop, no silent auto-merge\n\n## New User Onboarding\nnpm install -g actp\nactp init -n \"my-project\"\nactp capture \"first decision\" --symbol ??\nactp save --message \"Initial setup\"\nactp login\nactp sync --push\nactp rehydrate context.actp.json\n\n## UX Philosophy (ChatGPT)\n- File-based workflow\n- Transparent JSON\n- No hidden state\n- AI optional layer\n\nACTP is not an AI chat interface.\nACTP is an AI workflow state manager.\n",
      "size": 915,
      "type": "text",
      "checksum": "f4c403b7376de95fc0b7f690abf2e8ee4a8f649201b80b93a137eeb6ca30d340"
    },
    {
      "path": "benchmarks/sessions/actp-session-v1.2.json",
      "content": "{\n  \"packet_meta\": {\n    \"format\": \"ACTP-session-summary-v1.2\",\n    \"created\": \"2026-04-16T02:45:00Z\",\n    \"session_id\": \"maestro-panel-fix-session\",\n    \"origin_model\": \"Claude Opus 4.5\",\n    \"previous_version\": \"actp-unified-v1.1.json\"\n  },\n\n  \"projects\": {\n    \"maestro\": {\n      \"name\": \"Maestro\",\n      \"github\": \"https://github.com/samiboran/maestro\",\n      \"local_path\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\pc\\\\Desktop\\\\maestro\",\n      \"status\": \"v0.2+ panel fixes in progress\"\n    },\n    \"actp_spec\": {\n      \"name\": \"ACTP Spec\",\n      \"github\": \"https://github.com/samiboran/actp-spec\",\n      \"local_path\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\pc\\\\Desktop\\\\actp-spec\",\n      \"status\": \"v0.4 stable\"\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"session_accomplishments\": [\n    \"✅ react-rnd kütüphanesi kuruldu (npm install react-rnd)\",\n    \"✅ DraggablePanel.jsx react-rnd ile refactor edildi\",\n    \"✅ ApiKeyModal'a X butonu ve 'Şimdilik Geç' eklendi\",\n    \"✅ snap-guides çizgileri tespit edildi (kaldırılacak)\",\n    \"✅ Panel pozisyonlama debug edildi (console.log eklendi)\",\n    \"✅ SAFE_MARGIN (10px) eklendi overflow için\",\n    \"✅ bounds='window' kaldırıldı (react-rnd bug fix)\"\n  ],\n\n  \"ongoing_issues\": {\n    \"panel_right_missing\": {\n      \"problem\": \"GPT-OSS 120B (right snap) paneli görünmüyor\",\n      \"root_cause\": \"react-rnd bounds='window' + x=100% hesaplaması overflow yapıyor\",\n      \"debug_output\": \"Panel right: x=1610, y=231 (viewport 400px olunca ekran dışı)\",\n      \"attempted_fixes\": [\n        \"Clamp fonksiyonu eklendi\",\n        \"SAFE_MARGIN (10px) eklendi\",\n        \"bounds='window' kaldırıldı\"\n      ],\n      \"status\": \"Bazen görünüyor, bazen kayıp — instabil\"\n    },\n    \"snap_guides_lines\": {\n      \"problem\": \"Ekranda dikey çizgiler panel hareketini engelliyor\",\n      \"location\": \"App.jsx satır 101-106, .snap-guides div\",\n      \"fix\": \"Bu bloğu silmek gerekiyor\"\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"current_file_state\": {\n    \"DraggablePanel.jsx\": {\n      \"library\": \"react-rnd\",\n      \"SNAP_POINTS\": [\n        { \"id\": \"left\", \"x\": 0, \"y\": 35 },\n        { \"id\": \"right\", \"x\": 100, \"y\": 35 },\n        { \"id\": \"bottom-center\", \"x\": 50, \"y\": 70 }\n      ],\n      \"SAFE_MARGIN\": 10,\n      \"bounds\": \"removed (was 'window')\",\n      \"debug_logging\": true\n    },\n    \"App.jsx\": {\n      \"MODELS\": [\n        { \"id\": \"claude\", \"name\": \"Llama 3.3 70B\", \"initialSnap\": \"left\" },\n        { \"id\": \"chatgpt\", \"name\": \"GPT-OSS 120B\", \"initialSnap\": \"right\" },\n        { \"id\": \"gemini\", \"name\": \"Groq Compound\", \"initialSnap\": \"bottom-center\" }\n      ],\n      \"snap_guides\": \"Needs to be removed (lines 101-106)\"\n    },\n    \"ApiKeyModal.jsx\": {\n      \"features\": [\"X close button\", \"Şimdilik Geç button\", \"Kaydet ve Başla button\"]\n    },\n    \"App.css\": {\n      \"modal\": \"position: relative added\",\n      \"duplicate_modal_rule\": \"Fixed (was defined twice)\"\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"groq_api\": {\n    \n    \"models_used\": [\n      { \"panel\": \"claude\", \"model\": \"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\" },\n      { \"panel\": \"chatgpt\", \"model\": \"openai/gpt-oss-120b\" },\n      { \"panel\": \"gemini\", \"model\": \"groq/compound\" }\n    ],\n    \"worker_url\": \"https://maestro-proxy.s-borankocoglu.workers.dev\"\n  },\n\n  \"next_session_tasks\": {\n    \"priority_1_fix\": [\n      \"App.jsx'ten snap-guides bloğunu sil (satır 101-106)\",\n      \"Panel right (GPT-OSS) görünürlük sorununu kalıcı çöz\",\n      \"react-rnd bounds stratejisini yeniden değerlendir\"\n    ],\n    \"priority_2_ui\": [\n      \"Prompt kutusu width auto-resize\",\n      \"Sol sidebar (Claude benzeri)\",\n      \"Synthesis box sadece 3 response sonrası göster (tamamlandı)\"\n    ],\n    \"priority_3_deploy\": [\n      \"Cloudflare Pages deploy\",\n      \"ACTP Export butonu UI'a ekle\"\n    ]\n  },\n\n  \"multi_model_consultation\": {\n    \"method\": \"ACTP JSON format ile 3 modele soru sorma\",\n    \"models_consulted\": [\"Llama 3.3 70B\", \"GPT-OSS 120B\", \"Groq Compound\"],\n    \"insights\": [\n      \"react-rnd bounds='window' sınırlara çok hassas\",\n      \"x=100% hesaplamasında scrollbar/border/padding hesaba katılmalı\",\n      \"SAFE_MARGIN (5-10px) her zaman kullanılmalı\"\n    ]\n  },\n\n  \"key_learnings\": {\n    \"react_rnd\": {\n      \"issue\": \"bounds='window' + percentage positioning = overflow risk\",\n      \"solution\": \"SAFE_MARGIN + clamp + possibly bounds='parent' with container\"\n    },\n    \"debugging\": {\n      \"method\": \"console.log ile x/y değerlerini yazdır\",\n      \"finding\": \"DevTools açıkken viewport küçülüyor, paneller ekran dışı kalıyor\"\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"session_workflow\": {\n    \"actp_packets_location\": \"actp-spec/benchmarks/sessions/\",\n    \"naming_convention\": \"actp-unified-vX.X.json\",\n    \"archive_folder\": \"actp-spec/benchmarks/sessions/archive/\"\n  }\n}\n",
      "size": 4654,
